    "aboveFold": true
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 9,
   "tag": "div×2",
   "class": "duet--article--article-body-component",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 227,
   "text": "Damn straight. The short-lived app was free, easy to use, and fast — the digital disrobing only took 30 seconds.\nIn other words, it had all the ingredients necessary to turn an unsuspecting woman’s existence into a living hell.",
